1. Removed the local dialog import
2. Imported Dialog components directly from '@radix-ui/react-dialog'
3. Used Dialog components with proper namespace (Dialog.Root, Dialog.Portal, Dialog.Content)
4. Maintained the same component structure but with direct Radix UI components

This should resolve the undefined component error since we're now using the components directly from the Radix UI library rather than through a potentially problematic local implementation.

